{"id":"34aec31cb9fa742a","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-antipodal-map.md","title":"Antipodal Map","display":"df-antipodal-map — Antipodal Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-antipodal-map","aliases":["58-df-antipodal-map"],"display":"df-antipodal-map — Antipodal Map","depends_on":["[[58-df-sphere]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-antipodal-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-antipodal-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-antipodal-map — Antipodal Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"58-df-sphere\">58-df-sphere</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (dimension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}:\\lVert x\\rVert_2=1\\}\">\\(S^n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}:\\lVert x\\rVert_2=1\\}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-sphere, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"58-df-sphere\">58-df-sphere</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:S^n\\to S^n\">\\(A:S^n\\to S^n\\)</span> (function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AntipodalMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AntipodalMap}_S\\)</span> (antipodal map predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}antipodal\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{AntipodalMap}_S(A,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land A:S^n\\to S^n\\land\\forall x\\in S^n\\;(A(x)=-x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}antipodal\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{AntipodalMap}_S(A,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land A:S^n\\to S^n\\land\\forall x\\in S^n\\;(A(x)=-x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The antipodal map sends each point of the sphere to its opposite point.</li>\n<li>The dimension is an explicit predicate argument; the sphere is then fixed by the upstream definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sphere","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sphere]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sphere","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S^n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}:\\lVert x\\rVert_2=1\\}$ ($n$-sphere, see [[58-df-sphere]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A:S^n\\to S^n$ (function, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S^n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}:\\lVert x\\rVert_2=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"A:S^n\\to S^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AntipodalMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}antipodal\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{AntipodalMap}_S(A,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land A:S^n\\to S^n\\land\\forall x\\in S^n\\;(A(x)=-x)","display":true}],"bytes":881,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-antipodal-map.md|58-df-antipodal-map]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["ed44d43cf74ca35e","36d7463d215be751"]}